    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ghost Vanguard</strong> is a Beat'em Up game that combines stylish action with roguelike elements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.poster.avif?t=1749656095\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.webm?t=1749656095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.mp4?t=1749656095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unleash stylish combos in a 2D Belt-Scroll Beat'em Up combat.<br></li><li> Explore various combo styles with weapon, spell, and relic combinations, adding depth to your strategic builds.<br></li><li> Encounter enemies with diverse attack patterns, leading to exhilarating and challenging battles.<br></li><li> Presenting a dark fantasy world through finely crafted 2D pixel art.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Ghost Vanguard</strong> is a Beat'em Up game that combines stylish action with roguelike elements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.poster.avif?t=1749656095\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.webm?t=1749656095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577430/extras/88a2d6ae7e14f5e83cf6a73b421181e9.mp4?t=1749656095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unleash stylish combos in a 2D Belt-Scroll Beat'em Up combat.<br></li><li> Explore various combo styles with weapon, spell, and relic combinations, adding depth to your strategic builds.<br></li><li> Encounter enemies with diverse attack patterns, leading to exhilarating and challenging battles.<br></li><li> Presenting a dark fantasy world through finely crafted 2D pixel art.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ghost Vanguard is a Beat'em Up game that combines stylish action with roguelike elements. Grab your sword and step into treacherous evil dungeons, using stylish and magnificent combos to defeat the sinister forces from the darkness!",
